  "description": "\"Wow~ Your eyes are creepy, which makes me turned on!\" Even after a few years, I remember it vividly. Dan Hee-on, that woman who made a lustful expression while looking at my scar. Ever since that day, Hyun Hwa has lived chasing after the traces of the disappeared Hee-on, not even knowing if it was anger or love-hate. When they meet again in an unexpected place, Hee-on pretends not to know Hwa at all while enjoying inflicting wounds on his body... Hee-on tries to grab the leash, and Hwa isn't easily caught. In the end, who will be the winner of this game?\nSource: MU",
